        "Background": "Acacia serves the Order of Chaos, a group bent on reviving ancient magic to usher in an age of discord. Alongside her partner Saspar she carries out whatever the Order asks, armed with witchcraft and a retinue of demons. The Order's goals mean little to her, though: she's devoted to Saspar, and serves Chaos only because he does, hoping one day to be more to him than a partner."
