    {
      "pages": [2],
      "sub": [],
      "fields": {
        "Background": "Acacia: Lines in Full\n-2 Focus (Flight/Incorporeal Form Require Hat)\n\nAcacia: Attacks\nLock Heaven's Door (Perks: Fatiguing, Unique Perk: Prevents Healing/Recovering Until Battle's End): A stroke of her finger saps the target's energy and fills them with dread.\nDevil's Breath: A chilling breath clouds the target's mind.\n\nAcacia: Character Hooks\nThe Order of Chaos makes Acacia and Saspar natural enemies for anyone defending the world from evil — Fukiko and Auren, whose backgrounds both feature a vague darkness to be fought, fit especially well. They can also serve as magical rivals."
      }
